lor:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%;padding-left:8pt">Grant outcomes are contingent upon achievement of Non&#8209;GAAP Operating Profit, as follows:</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:4pt;padding-left:11.52pt"><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%">-&#160;100% of target three-year performance (2025-2027)</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:4pt;padding-left:10.8pt;text-indent:-10.8pt"><span style="color:#00e28b;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%">&#8226;</span><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%;padding-left:8pt">Payouts of 0% to 200% of target based on performance</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt"><span><br/></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt"><span><br/></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt"><span><br/></span></div></td><td colspan="21" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:9.00pt">Non-GAAP Operating Profit-Based Cash</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt"><span><br/></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt"><span><br/></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt"><span><br/></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="padding-left:3.6pt"><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-si