dding:0 1pt"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt"><span><br/></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#73efbf;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #2a2a2a;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="padding-left:3.6pt"><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:130%">50% of target</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #2a2a2a;padding:0 1pt"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt"><span><br/></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#73efbf;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #2a2a2a;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="padding-left:3.6pt"><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:130%">100% of target </span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #2a2a2a;padding:0 1pt"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt"><span><br/></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#00e28b;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #2a2a2a;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="padding-left:3.6pt"><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:130%">200% of target </span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #00e28b;padding:0 1pt"><div style="padding-right:-2.63pt"><span><br/></span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #00e28b;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="27" style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #00e28b;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="margin-bottom:4pt;padding-left:10.8pt;text-indent:-10.8pt"><span style="color:#00e28b;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%">&#8226;</span><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%;padding-left:8pt">Results are interpolated between Threshold and Target, and between Target and Maximum.</span></div></td></tr></table></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt"><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:125%">Time-based RSU awards are settled in stock, while rTSR-based and Non-GAAP Operating Profit-based cash awards are paid in cash, in each case upon vesting and the certification of results by the Committee for the performance-based awards. The payout scale of the cash awards does not fluctuate based on changes in our stock price. </span></div><div style="margin-bottom:4pt"><span style="color:#003134;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Performance Periods for all 2025 rTSR-Based and Non-GAAP Operating Profit-</span><span style="font-family:'null',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"></span><span style="color:#003134;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Based&#160;Awards:</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:12pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.881%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:13.692%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:20.201%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:20.201%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:20.201%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:20.205%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:130%">Vesting </span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:130%">2025</span></td><td colspan="3" sty