tually Paid&#8221; have been calculated in accordance with Item&#160;402(v) of Regulation&#160;S-K and do not reflect compensation actually earned, realized, or received by the Company&#8217;s NEOs. These amounts reflect the amount shown in the &#8220;Total&#8221; column set forth in the Summary Compensation Table with certain adjustments as described in footnote 3 below. </span></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></div><ix:continuation id="f-71-1"><ix:continuation id="f-70-1"><div style="margin-bottom:8pt;padding-left:14.4pt;text-indent:-14.4pt"><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%">(3)</span><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%;padding-left:5.85pt">&#8220;Compensation Actually Paid&#8221; reflects the exclusions and inclusions of certain amounts for the PEO and the Non-PEO NEOs as set forth below. Equity values are calculated in accordance with FASB ASC Topic 718. Amounts in the &#8220;Exclusion of Stock Awards&#8221; column are the totals from the &#8220;Stock Awards&#8221; columns set forth in the Summary Compensation Table and amounts in the &#8220;Inclusion of Equity Values&#8221; column are the aggregate adjustments required for this purpose by SEC rules. </span></div><div style="margin-bottom:8pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.881%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:42.834%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:13.101%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:13.101%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:13.101%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:12.363%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div><span style="color:#2a2a2a;font-family:'Arial',sans-